# Device-test evidence and dex/APK archaeology. Large, machine-specific, and
# regenerable: `.dexwork` alone is a 200 MB `dexdump` of the shipped APK, and
# `.device-test` holds pulled exports, 900k-line logcat dumps and screenshots.
# Keeping them out of history is deliberate — they were never source.
.dexwork/
.device-test/

